UMLExpress
==========

A native macOS UML editor written in Swift.

This program is a derivative work of JetUML 3.10
(https://github.com/prmr/JetUML), Copyright (C) 2012-2025 by
McGill University. JetUML is distributed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3, and so is this program; see LICENSE.

The behaviour, the class structure and the file format of this program
follow JetUML: the diagram model, the renderers, the edge routing, the
validation rules, the operations with undo/redo and the `.jet` file
format are ports of the corresponding Java classes. Each source file
that contains ported code carries a header naming the original class and
the upstream license.

Bundled third-party assets
--------------------------

The tool-palette icons and the action icons are drawn with the renderers
or copied from `JetUML/icons` (JetUML 3.10, GPL-3, McGill University).

